SCOPE OF THIS FILE

The licence above covers the original LLapis code in this repository: the
`moert/` runtime library, `src/`, `cli/`, `scripts/`, `tests/`, the build files,
and the LLapis changes carried by `patches/`.

It does NOT relicense anything else. In particular:

  * llama.cpp, which this project patches and builds against, stays under its
    own MIT licence (Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors). `patches/`
    contains a diff, not a copy; the upstream sources are fetched from
    ggml-org/llama.cpp at the pinned commit by `scripts/bootstrap.ps1`.

  * The prebuilt web UI in `ui-dist/` is a compiled bundle. It contains code
    from third-party packages, each under its own licence, and the LLapis MIT
    grant does not extend to them.

  * Third-party libraries vendored inside the llama.cpp tree and reachable from
    the shipped binaries keep their own licences.

  * Model weights are not part of this repository and are not distributed by
    it. LLapis reads GGUF files the user obtains themselves, under whatever
    terms the model publisher sets.

THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt lists every third-party component with its licence,
version and source, and reproduces the notices those licences require.
